  "title": "Firefly Completes Oversubscribed $75M Series A and $100M Secondary Transaction",
  "summary": "CEDAR PARK, Texas-Firefly Aerospace Inc., a leading provider of economical and dependable launch vehicles, spacecraft, and in-space services, today announced the successful completion of its Series A financing. The $75 million Series A, which valued the company at greater than $1 billion, was led by DADA Holdings, with participation by Astera Institute, Canon Ball LLC,...",
